sequenceDiagram
    %% End-to-End Authentication & Authorization Flow

    autonumber
    actor User as User Browser
    participant FE as Next.js (React 19)
    participant Axios as Axios Interceptor (lib/axios.ts)
    participant RateLimit as ASP.NET Rate Limiter
    participant AuthAPI as AuthController (/api/auth)
    participant Identity as ASP.NET Core Identity
    participant Mongo as MongoDB (applicationUsers)
    participant Svc as Domain Service (e.g. CompanyService)

    %% Login Sequence
    User->>FE: Fill Email & Password -> Click "Log In"
    FE->>RateLimit: POST /api/auth/login
    RateLimit->>RateLimit: Check IP fixed window (<= 5 / min)
    RateLimit->>AuthAPI: Forward validated request
    AuthAPI->>Identity: FindByNameAsync(email)
    Identity->>Mongo: Find user by NormalizedEmail
    Mongo-->>Identity: Return ApplicationUser document
    Identity->>Identity: CheckPasswordSignInAsync(hash)
    Identity-->>AuthAPI: Credentials Validated
    AuthAPI->>AuthAPI: Mint JWT (sub, email, roles[], 8h exp)
    AuthAPI-->>FE: HTTP 200 OK + JWT Token

    %% Client Session Hydration
    FE->>FE: localStorage.setItem("token", jwt)
    FE->>FE: window.dispatchEvent(storage) [Sync all tabs]
    FE->>Axios: Initialize Authorization: Bearer <jwt>

    %% Authenticated API Invocation
    User->>FE: Navigate to Dashboard / Trigger Operation
    FE->>Axios: api.get("/api/company/my-company")
    Axios->>Axios: Attach Header "Authorization: Bearer <jwt>"
    Axios->>RateLimit: Forward Request
    RateLimit->>AuthAPI: Process HTTP Pipeline
    AuthAPI->>AuthAPI: JwtBearerHandler: Validate Signature & Expiry
    AuthAPI->>AuthAPI: OnTokenValidated: Map 'sub' -> ClaimTypes.NameIdentifier
    AuthAPI->>AuthAPI: AuthorizeAttribute: Verify Roles
    AuthAPI->>Svc: Invoke GetMyCompanyAsync(userId)
    Svc->>Svc: Ownership Assertion: AssertAccess(company.UserId == userId)
    Svc->>Mongo: Query Companies where UserId == userId
    Mongo-->>Svc: Return Company Document
    Svc-->>AuthAPI: Return Company DTO
    AuthAPI-->>FE: HTTP 200 OK (ApiResponse Envelope)
    FE-->>User: Render Dashboard UI
